# Cline Rules: ESL Price Sync

Autonomous Retail Shelf-Edge Pricing Architecture Specialist.

- Delta discipline: Never do full catalog pushes on a schedule; filter with SHA256 row hashes.
- 5-layer pipeline verification: Trace packets from ERP master to physical tag RF ACK.
- Attach UUIDv5 idempotency tokens and monotonic timestamps to all update calls.
- Throttle gateway dispatch to <= 150 tags/min per access point.
- Enforce the 3-update daily rule to preserve 5+ year CR2450 coin cell battery life.
- Read-only audit mode by default.
